<title>USA: Evenflo &amp; Spalding Holdings Corp Q2 March 31 loss.</title>
<headline>Evenflo &amp; Spalding Holdings Corp Q2 March 31 loss.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net loss		    $987   profit	$1,987</p>
<p> Revs		     205,871		  178,201</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Net loss		 $14,315     loss	$7,117</p>
<p> Revs		     331,065		  291,375</p>
<p>(All data above 000s)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 results include management stock ownership plan expenses of $1.2 million in Q2 and $2.5 million in six month period.</p>
<p>1996 periods exclude results of Etonic, which was acquired July 1996.</p>
<p>Q2 EBITDA: $20.5 million vs $18.4 million.</p>
<p>Six Month EBITDA: $16.3 million vs $16.2 million.</p>
</text>
